      "id": 1310701,
      "name": "[Ellen] Blizzard Trim",
      "desc": "With<color=#FFFFFF>Flash Freeze Charge</color>, the third move of <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Flash Freeze Trimming</color> replaces <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack: Cold Snap</color>. During this skill , gain a <color=#2BAD00>shield equal to 20% of Max HP</color>. While Ellen has this shield, her <color=#2BAD00>Anti-Interrupt Level increases</color>, and <color=#2BAD00>DMG taken is reduced by 60%</color>. Activating <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter: Reef Rock</color> grants Ellen 1 <color=#FFFFFF>Flash Freeze Charge</color>.",
